            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "6.4 Making Adolescence a Joyful Experience"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 2,
          "bbox": [
            0.114,
            0.156,
            0.744,
            0.269
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "The journey of adolescence is a unique experience. Heightened curiosity and excitement during this stage of life give adolescents a new viewpoint towards almost everything around them. Good habits, thoughtful decisions, and small actions can have a powerful positive impact on the overall well-being of adolescents. Let us know about them!"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.115,
            0.279,
            0.532,
            0.303
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "6.4.1 Meeting nutritional needs"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.114,
            0.308,
            0.744,
            0.384
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "In Grade 6 chapter ‘Mindful Eating: A Path to a Healthy Body’, you learnt about the need for a healthy diet. Since adolescence is a period of growth and development marked by several changes in the body, a nutritious diet is of utmost importance."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.126,
            0.389,
