            0.264,
            0.419,
            0.577,
            0.475
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "For proper growth, and to perform well on the playground, we need proteins and carbohydrates!"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.348,
            0.493,
            0.641,
            0.549
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Not only that, we also need an adequate amount of fats, vitamins, and minerals as well!"
            }
          ]
        },
